/// known-gap: interp actions cannot be kept in a list and called later
/// `v [= item` in a loop body is a fresh name each pass, like `v | item`:
/// actions made in different passes each keep their own pass's value.
act make()
    fs | []
    repeat [1, 2, 3] as item
        v [= item
        act show()
            return v
        xx
        :put_last!(fs, show)
    xx
    return fs
xx
repeat make() as s
    say(s())
xx
